; language and communication therapy to strengthen verbal and social communication; and adult counselling to support parents and caregivers. Rays of Belief Limited was incorporated in 2017 and is headquartered in Gurugram, India. Rays of Belief Limited operates as a subsidiary of Carving Futures Pte. Ltd.","employees":null,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":null,"asOf":1795210528},"analyst":null,"cap":"Other","caFix":null,"fetched":1795210528,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"RAYS OF BELIEF\" when:90d","items":[{"t":"Rays Of Belief Got SEBI Nod To Launch Its IPO","s":"https://www.fintechbiznews.com/","d":1793337659,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxOYWhSenZJYlNQeGFNdllsYU5xOXBXMEpvbFl0ZEx2VWFaNWdVN1NVcEVwQTFsYUFZdllCOFZqSGhFRGU4NnBGZTlHZFVaZzZhUFBicV82cHFYMUdvWGF0NFp4RU44cjdKYjVEd2lXRk1IUjhDMDVkaWx6YXBDdGRKTWlSZjZvTHlzbExvQ2dyWnFWSThSVzhQRllIczI?oc=5","g":["plan"]},{"t":"Rays of Belief Ltd Key Financial Ratios – Valuation, Profitability & More","s":"Value Research","d":1788908181,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxPZ3BPbS1KanBNMjZrZlJ0cWVYaXZ5aDVHbmtzQjZDSTNmczlCbmhyT1lYS3BhNVh2LUNFT2I2dEhPS29iT3EyWG5uUHJxcHhzRzBSWjZpeEdfc29VOUZQVDlxXzhlYmxmZHRKajFrcG1Pek94ejJ1elV2Qm5wRDE5d0xFVGRUTjA?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Rays of Belief Ltd Shareholding Pattern – Promoters, FIIs & DIIs","s":"Value Research","d":1788908181,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxORDlwbDh3VTJMYjNVOThGbnptVUxMdGx1Mk9JaG45eGJtWE4wWTlJMF8yYUwzaTluMnJ6Z0NsUXBnSzBZd2FOb184MW5iYWVNTVRUOE1CN001NDhFZ0JjSW9QcW1sNWVPNDJFUVRFenY2ODVESFl5ak0tYmVwMEVuYU5paWZXWDZ4RGc?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Rays Of Belief IPO Listing: Shares List Flat On Stock Exchanges.","s":"Kotak Neo","d":1788850800,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidkFVX3lxTFBUbTVpeV9NbDBXR29PZkhDajlpM3lBUUhhYUh6UlZUN21fNVFvcGs3UDY0RWdPSU1mTWZjdnNRT2N1Sm51dHZLSUlUZFpPWlNiYjBaR2VMZ2czR3lFbUY3a0o1VVVrVnRuMEdZM0RpcDZEUGU3OXc?oc=5","g":["pl